Z||000002||rockcrawl||09-19-2000||07:19 AM||||Some key words to search for might be: th440t4, 440t4, 4t60, 4t60e. Those are the commonly fitted four speed autos. The first three are the same, fourth is the electronic version. They can be found in most front wheel drive GM cars from 85-95? that had a four speed. I am wondering how I can determine the final drive ratios of three 4t60 transmissions I have. <P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'86 GT 3800 (for sale)<BR>'87 GT (noisey 2.8)<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)||||reg||1
